\newlabel{fig:ch4_closed_recovery_graph}{{4}{8}{Closed-recovery candidate graph between critical closed beams and helper recovery beam candidates. The left-side nodes $b_{s,\ell }^{\mathrm {off}}$ denote closed beams on critical satellites, and the right-side nodes $b_{h,k}^{\mathrm {rec}}$ denote helper recovery beam candidates. An edge $e=(b_{s,\ell }^{\mathrm {off}},b_{h,k}^{\mathrm {rec}})$ exists when the two beams have footprint overlap}{figure.4}{}}
